### 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "test1234",
  "nickname": "테스트유저"
}

### 로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "test1234"
}

### 내 정보 조회 (로그인 후 발급된 토큰으로 교체)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIiwiaWF0IjoxNzc5OTMxMTUwLCJleHAiOjE3ODAwMTc1NTB9._-GGcRBy7w6yyNnnuHPU-Ubnis9wNdFt6QvhNQhCDMpo39HMMLCAyWto3ph5BGzs

### 제품 등록 (관리자)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIiwiaWF0IjoxNzc5OTMxMTUwLCJleHAiOjE3ODAwMTc1NTB9._-GGcRBy7w6yyNnnuHPU-Ubnis9wNdFt6QvhNQhCDMpo39HMMLCAyWto3ph5BGzs

